# synstudio effect
name    bluescreen
label   Blue screen
group   Key
about   The same, for a blue backing
alpha   1
param   similarity  0.2   0.01  1  Similarity
param   blend       0.05  0     1  Blend
filter  [$in]format=rgba,chromakey=color=0x0047bb:similarity=$similarity:
filter  blend=$blend[$out]
